            return "<note>\((chord).toTemplate())<pitch><step>\((step).toTemplate())</step><octave>\((octave).toTemplate())</octave></pitch><duration>4</duration>" + "<voice>1</voice><type>whole</type>\((staff).toTemplate())<notations><technical>\((technical).toTemplate())</technical></notations></note>"
        }
